### Listar (no projeto base devolve todos, sem paginação)
GET http://localhost:8080/properties

### Um imóvel
GET http://localhost:8080/properties/7

### Imóvel inexistente → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/properties/999

### Criar → 201
POST http://localhost:8080/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Apartamento com varanda gourmet",
  "description": "Perto do metrô Fradique Coutinho",
  "type": "APARTMENT",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "neighborhood": "Pinheiros",
  "price": 4200.00,
  "bedrooms": 2,
  "area": 72.5
}

### Criar inválido → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "", "type": "APARTMENT"}

### Atualizar → 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/properties/7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Apartamento reformado",
  "description": "Atualizado pelo teste",
  "type": "APARTMENT",
  "city": "Rio de Janeiro",
  "neighborhood": "Tijuca",
  "price": 2900.00,
  "bedrooms": 2,
  "area": 70
}

### Excluir → 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/properties/7

### ===== Diamante 03 (depois de implementar) =====

### Página 2 com 5 itens
GET http://localhost:8080/properties?page=2&size=5

### Query by Example
GET http://localhost:8080/properties/example?type=APARTMENT&city=são paulo&bedrooms=2

### Specification
GET http://localhost:8080/properties/search?title=varanda&minPrice=2000&maxPrice=6000&minBedrooms=2

### Actuator
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

